android.desc:
Do you struggle to stay in touch with important people in your life, such as friends, family, colleagues, customers or business contacts on a regular basis? 😬 

Do you find yourself losing your social connections due to forgetting to catch up with old friends? 😬

Is a long-distance friendship or other relationship maintenance too hard? 😬

Has it already been a month since you last talked to your mum? 😱

<b>Take control of your social life with Smart Contact Reminder, your personal CRM and relationship manager!</b> 💪💪💪




<b>Smart Contact Reminder helps users with ADHD especially. It can be of great help if ADHD causes problems with keeping in touch with your loved ones.</b>




<b>Smart Contact Reminder can also help you maintain your business connections.</b> 🏢

Keep track of meetings, agendas, conversations and other interactions with your business partners.

Strengthen your professional network by intentionally reconnecting at the right time. Get notified of important repeating events.




<b>Make staying in touch your new habit and build your personal and business relationships stronger.</b>



<h1><b>Main features</b></h1>
 • <b>get regular contact reminders</b> so you stay in touch;
 • <b>get event reminders</b> such as birthdays and anniversaries;
 • <b>fuzzy contact reminders</b> so you don't always talk to mum on the same day of the week;
 • <b>phonebook integration</b> to import all your existing contacts;
 • <b>customizable categories</b> to manage your contacts according to your needs;
 • <b>get in touch straight from notifications</b>, there's no need to open and search within the app;
 • <b>integration with popular messaging apps</b> as well as your e-mail client or phone app;
 • <b>automatic detection of contact</b> for effortless logging of contacts from other apps;
 • <b>keep your contact history</b> and your notes to be reminded of important events next time you reconnect;
 • <b>automatic backups</b> of your data;
 • <b>widget for your home screen</b>;



<h2><b>👩 Adding your contacts</b></h2>
Smart Contact Reminder allows you to either add contacts individually or use the batch import feature to add existing contacts from your phonebook. Use predefined categories - which we call circles - to sort your contacts according to the strength of your relationship. Every circle has an adjustable reminder interval.



